      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 27",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 27",
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "图　27",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这四条线段的端点构成一个多面体的顶点，它的六个面都是平行四边形。\n这样的多面体称为平行六面体。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "这四条线段的端点是多面体的顶点，所有的六个面都是平行四边形. 这样的多面体叫做平行六面体.",
      "changes": ["language", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "长方体是平行六面体的一种特殊情形（图 28）。\n它的所有面都是矩形。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "你们已经知道的长方体就是一种特殊的平行六面体（图28）. 它的所有的面都是矩形.",
      "changes": ["language", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题：在平行六面体 $ABCDA_1B_1C_1D_1$ 中（图 29），点 $M$、$N$、$P$ 分别位于棱 $DD_1$、$BB_1$、$CC_1$ 上，且 $(MP)\\mathrel{\\not\\mathbin{//}}(DC)$，$(MN)\\mathrel{\\not\\mathbin{//}}(DB)$。\n\n求作平面 $MNP$ 与平面 $ABC$ 的交线。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 25,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#11",
        "p0033#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "问题. 在平行六面体 $ABCDA_1B_1C_1D_1$ 里（图 29），点 $M$、$N$、$P$ 分别属于棱 $DD_1$、$BB_1$、$CC_1$，并且 $(MP)\\mathrel{\\not\\mathbin{//}}(DC)$，$(MN)\\mathrel{\\not\\mathbin{//}}(DB)$. 求作平面 $MNP$ 和 $ABC$ 的交线.",
      "changes": ["language", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-28",
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 26,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-29",
      "label": "图 29",
      "printed_page": 26,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 28",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 26,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "图　28",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 29",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 29",
      "printed_page": 26,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0033#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "图　29",
